# Delegated Authority Forum backend on Java 25 / Spring Boot 4: daf-api (api/), daf-rules (rules/),
# daf-docgen (docgen/) and daf-soap (soap/), the legacy review mandates services.
# The UI is the Credit platform DAF remote (credit-platform repository), deployed from there.
# STACK_DIR is relative to this repository's root (the stack files sit at the root).
# REMOTE_NAME: /opt/docker/backend/daf-boot (APIs live under backend/, cat-utils docs/DEPLOYMENT.md).
# Deployed on the platform DEV server: deploy/pam-deploy.sh daf rmb-rbvdvcsdm01 -u <your AD user>
# (DEV = :latest; -b <build> only for other environments)
# Images: credit/daf-boot/{daf-api,daf-rules,daf-docgen,daf-soap}:<BUILD_NUMBER>
STACK_DIR=.
REMOTE_NAME=backend/daf-boot
FILES="docker-compose.yml latest.sh env.properties.example"
TAG_VAR=BUILD_NUMBER
PORT_VARS="API_PORT RULES_PORT DOCGEN_PORT SOAP_PORT"
# End to end through the platform: credit-systems nginx -> API gateway -> /daf -> this server:API_PORT
# (the gateway's /daf upstream is <server>/approvalforum/api/, so this is daf-api's actuator health).
VERIFY_URL="https://credit-systems-${TARGET_ENV}.rmb.co.za/gateway/daf/actuator/health"
LOG_TAIL_SECONDS=12
